{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2040958046382551170","created_at":"2026-04-06T02:23:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2040978687152345284"],"id":"2040978687152345284","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":84880,"like_count":143,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2040958046382551170","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"不好意思让大家费心了❤️我只是最近工作有点累，有了些躺平的想法简单发发牢骚，我才19岁，我不可能躺平，也不可能一直颓废下去，我接下来还会变工作边学习提升学历的，我不该有躺平的这种想法🥺","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2040978687152345284"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2040958046382551170","created_at":"2026-04-06T01:01:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2040958046382551170"],"id":"2040958046382551170","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":605,"impression_count":688730,"like_count":1458,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":499,"retweet_count":79},"text":"求推荐适合躺平的城市，最好月租500以内，夏天没那么热， 没有各种小虫子，周边生活设施齐全，真的不想在工作了，我也没什么物欲，降低生活成本，我这点存款还能在躺几年","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2040958046382551170"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2040785356812173434","created_at":"2026-04-05T13:35:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2040785356812173434"],"id":"2040785356812173434","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":164,"impression_count":1214947,"like_count":1385,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":407,"retweet_count":18},"text":"像夜店那种下海的男模，他们吃的都是青春饭，等老了没学历没技术，体力活又干不动，他们最终的归宿是什么？😰","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2040785356812173434"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","conversation_id":"2040746519658426610","created_at":"2026-04-05T11:02:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2040746835023999027"],"id":"2040746835023999027","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20100,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"20407